<title>RUSSIA: Russian RTS shares index rises to record 320.34.</title>
<headline>Russian RTS shares index rises to record 320.34.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Trading System 24-share index rose 2.18 percent to close at a record 320.34 on a total market volume of $34.4 million on Monday, NAUFOR brokers association data showed.</p>
</text>
